{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"init","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initialEntities","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":"])"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Does ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" record changes — the data is already persisted.","type":"text"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This is ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"first-load"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" hydration only. Do not use this initializer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to “refresh from disk” mid-session by assigning into a live ","type":"text"},{"code":"EntityStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(e.g. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"state.items = EntityStore(fetched)"},{"type":"text","text":" from a CloudKit re-hydrate action)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In-memory state may hold unflushed writes or live UI bindings; wholesale"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"replacement silently drops them and surfaces as lost keystrokes. Use"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/merge(from:shouldReplace:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for that path — it records no changes and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lets you decide per-ID which side wins. Under "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPersistentCloudKitContainer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the gotcha is especially sharp: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".NSPersistentStoreRemoteChange"},{"type":"text","text":" fires for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"local saves too, so a naïve “refresh on remote change” observer feeds the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app its own writes."}]}],"type":"aside","style":"important","name":"Important"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Entities sharing an ID are collapsed to the first occurrence. A store"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cannot represent duplicates — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"positions"},{"type":"text","text":" holds one index per ID — and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"admitting them corrupts the index: the map would keep only the last"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"index while the array kept every copy, so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"count"},{"type":"text","text":" over-reports and a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"later delete orphans the earlier copy with no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"positions"},{"type":"text","text":" entry at all,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"leaving a row that is visible in "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/values"},{"type":"text","text":" but invisible to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/contains(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and the subscript. Persisted rows can legitimately"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"share an ID (CloudKit forbids unique constraints), so this initializer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has to be total rather than trusting its input."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/init(_:)"]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a store pre-populated from an array (e.g. first-load hydration at app launch)."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/init(_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}],"externalID":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreVyACyxGSayxGcfc","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"([","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"])","kind":"text"}],"roleHeading":"Initializer","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"init","title":"init(_:)"},"references":{"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore/merge(from:shouldReplace:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Merges entities from another store. Entities only present in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"other"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are always added; for IDs present in both, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"shouldReplace"},{"type":"text","text":" decides"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whether the incoming value overwrites the one already in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"self"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"merge"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EntityStore","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"shouldReplace"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swi